'''Spice''' was a business located in a shabby alley in [[Ord Mantell City]] on the [[planet]] [[Ord Mantell]]. The name of the establishment was written in [[Aurebesh]] and displayed on a [[Color|pink]], blue, and yellow sign, which was was mirror-inverted. Beneath that, the words "On your feet" were written, in a normal way.<ref name="Decommissioned" />

